### 1. Register customer 1 (run first after every restart)
POST http://localhost:8080/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "banana123",
  "phone": "5551234"
}

### 2. Add product 1 (Bananas)
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bananas",
  "description": "Fresh yellow bananas",
  "price": 1.29,
  "image": "banana.jpg",
  "quantity": 100
}

### 3. Add product 2 (Milk)
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Milk",
  "description": "Whole milk 1 gallon",
  "price": 3.49,
  "image": "milk.jpg",
  "quantity": 50
}

### 4. View cart (empty at first)
GET http://localhost:8080/cart/1

### 5. Add product 1 to cart
POST http://localhost:8080/cart/1/add/1

### 6. Add product 1 AGAIN (option B - quantity should bump to 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/cart/1/add/1

### 7. Add product 2, quantity 3
POST http://localhost:8080/cart/1/add/2?quantity=3

### 8. View cart (expect: product 1 qty 2, product 2 qty 3)
GET http://localhost:8080/cart/1

### 9. Remove product 1 from cart
DELETE http://localhost:8080/cart/1/remove/1

### 10. View cart (expect: only product 2 left)
GET http://localhost:8080/cart/1